1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:02,917
Howard, ugh,
my father was a police officer.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,120
(Bernadette:)We never knew
from one night to the next...

3
00:00:05,291 --> 00:00:08,501
...if he was gonna come home alive.
It was horrible.

4
00:00:08,669 --> 00:00:11,339
(Bernadette:)And I don't want to live
that way with you.

5
00:00:13,048 --> 00:00:15,178
Well, hey...

6
00:00:15,342 --> 00:00:19,842
(Howard:)...my father abandoned me
and my mother when I was 11.

7
00:00:20,639 --> 00:00:22,769
(Howard:)We never saw him again.

8
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:24,893
Oh, boo hoo, you're not going to space.

9
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,480
- Pretty cool about Howard, huh?
- Don't talk to me...

10
00:00:33,652 --> 00:00:37,032
(Sheldon:)...as if nothing's happened between us.
And yes, it sure is, buddy.

11
00:00:39,658 --> 00:00:42,078
(Leonard:)Will you stop
with the Schrödinger stuff?

12
00:00:42,244 --> 00:00:45,704
Would you prefer an application
of Heisenberg's uncertainty principle?

13
00:00:45,873 --> 00:00:48,043
(Sheldon:)In which I could either
know where you are...

14
00:00:48,208 --> 00:00:50,628
(Sheldon:)...or whether I like you, but not both?

15
00:00:51,962 --> 00:00:54,672
(Leonard:)You never stop talking, do you?

16
00:00:56,216 --> 00:00:59,636
What difference does it make
if Leonard goes to wil wheaton's party?

